      "versionNonce": 2009722507,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1753107053188,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "video is 60 fps (Frames Per Second)\nFrequency that we need to take the images from the video\n\n1 s ==> 60 frames \n4 images per second\n\n1min = 60 sec (4images per sec)\ntotal = 240 images\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "video is 60 fps (Frames Per Second)\nFrequency that we need to take the images from the video\n\n1 s ==> 60 frames \n4 images per second\n\n1min = 60 sec (4images per sec)\ntotal = 240 images\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
