      "updated": 1753107053189,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Hybrid Approach",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Hybrid Approach",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KcM2EwmYlATbvJbxcH4OG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8512.063608221142,
      "y": 5965.9234043201695,
      "width": 362.2594604492187,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "XhaMnRU1u6Fn8UWedNIXH",
        "ehzCNLjU7qLmBO_vAEEMR"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2GZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1588967279,
      "version": 472,
      "versionNonce": 890706155,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1753107053189,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Here each process needs to read the\nfull drivers sql file to do the joint\nqueeries",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Here each process needs to read the full drivers sql file to do the joint queeries",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jqqQUz2wUYVcUgrx37hGO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8509.263589910595,
      "y": 6062.323398216654,
      "width": 453.0596618652344,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "XhaMnRU1u6Fn8UWedNIXH",
        "ehzCNLjU7qLmBO_vAEEMR"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2Gd",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1700305377,
      "version": 731,
      "versionNonce": 809157515,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1753107053189,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Here in OMP we do the joint queries with \nmultiple threads,\n-each thread has its own data\n-compare with the full drivers array\n-if there is a match (user.id == driver.id) store\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Here in OMP we do the joint queries with \nmultiple threads,\n-each thread has its own data\n-compare with the full drivers array\n-if there is a match (user.id == driver.id) store\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "d0ynQnubRyXQMP3hVzltb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8682.463754705517,
      "y": 5640.323512657572,
      "width": 452.49945068359443,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "XhaMnRU1u6Fn8UWedNIXH",
        "ehzCNLjU7qLmBO_vAEEMR"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2Gl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 565995183,
      "version": 619,
      "versionNonce": 1792023083,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1753107053189,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Here the users sql file is divided in to these\nprocesses as if there are 900 sql records\nthere will be 300 rows per each process",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Here the users sql file is divided in to these processes as if there are 900 sql records\nthere will be 300 rows per each process",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
