      ],
      "updated": 1754109714435,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Each batch contains sent_id (input IDs), mask (attention masks), and labels\n(spam/non-spam labels).\n\nattention mask - In short, an attention mask guides the attention\nmechanism by specifying \"where to look\" and \"where not to look,\" enabling\nefficient and accurate processing of sequential data by ignoring irrelevant or\nunavailable information.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Each batch contains sent_id (input IDs), mask (attention masks), and labels (spam/non-spam labels).\n\nattention mask - In short, an attention mask guides the attention mechanism by specifying \"where to look\" and \"where not to look,\" enabling efficient and accurate processing of sequential data by ignoring irrelevant or unavailable information.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
