      "updated": 1758722362417,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 1: Initialize\n\nStart with two neural networks:\n\nMain (Online) Network → predicts Q-values.\n\nTarget Network → provides stable target values (initially a copy of the main network).\n\nInitialize an empty Replay Buffer.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 1: Initialize\n\nStart with two neural networks:\n\nMain (Online) Network → predicts Q-values.\n\nTarget Network → provides stable target values (initially a copy of the main network).\n\nInitialize an empty Replay Buffer.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
