      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "TV1HpIX2AZ4UyFB1qGTKX",
        "hvKSWD45A6-VhB9gx2ARX",
        "7AbNSvuwSHCRzG-bRdeIq",
        "hbAu7_xFaUE3wQnYuatSu"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bH5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1670599975,
      "version": 57,
      "versionNonce": 179326222,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1758722362417,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 3: Select an Action (ε-greedy)\n\nThe agent must decide what move to take:\n\nWith probability ε (exploration) → choose a random action (paddle up, down, stay).\n\nWith probability 1 – ε (exploitation) → choose the action with the highest Q-value predicted by the network.\n\nAt the start, ε is high (lots of exploration).\n\nOver time, ε decays → the agent uses the learned policy more.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 3: Select an Action (ε-greedy)\n\nThe agent must decide what move to take:\n\nWith probability ε (exploration) → choose a random action (paddle up, down, stay).\n\nWith probability 1 – ε (exploitation) → choose the action with the highest Q-value predicted by the network.\n\nAt the start, ε is high (lots of exploration).\n\nOver time, ε decays → the agent uses the learned policy more.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wno4r3sH2c7mew3sC1BB6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2191.911101723178,
      "y": 5739.8252002070785,
      "width": 704.8796997070312,
      "height": 405,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "TV1HpIX2AZ4UyFB1qGTKX",
        "hvKSWD45A6-VhB9gx2ARX",
        "7AbNSvuwSHCRzG-bRdeIq",
        "hbAu7_xFaUE3wQnYuatSu"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bH6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 698330153,
      "version": 83,
      "versionNonce": 1635744590,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1758722362417,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 4: Interact with Environment\n\nThe chosen action is applied to Pong.\n\nThe game returns:\n\nA reward (e.g., +1 if scoring, -1 if losing).\n\nThe next state (new frame after the action).",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 4: Interact with Environment\n\nThe chosen action is applied to Pong.\n\nThe game returns:\n\nA reward (e.g., +1 if scoring, -1 if losing).\n\nThe next state (new frame after the action).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ssl5XCHvKD-a3d2CCSfb3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2205.9109647177734,
      "y": 6359.825123913133,
      "width": 668.519775390625,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "TV1HpIX2AZ4UyFB1qGTKX",
        "hvKSWD45A6-VhB9gx2ARX",
        "7AbNSvuwSHCRzG-bRdeIq",
        "hbAu7_xFaUE3wQnYuatSu"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bH7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1110451687,
      "version": 98,
      "versionNonce": 1791943054,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1758722362417,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 5: Store Experience in Replay Buffer\n\nStore the experience:\n\n(state,action,reward,next_state)\n\nThis builds a memory of gameplay.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 5: Store Experience in Replay Buffer\n\nStore the experience:\n\n(state,action,reward,next_state)\n\nThis builds a memory of gameplay.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "OMI5ttI_WsEpxP-7VP61K",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2213.9110712056,
      "y": 6829.824971325243,
      "width": 1129.0675048828125,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "TV1HpIX2AZ4UyFB1qGTKX",
        "hvKSWD45A6-VhB9gx2ARX",
        "7AbNSvuwSHCRzG-bRdeIq",
        "hbAu7_xFaUE3wQnYuatSu"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bH8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 248537607,
      "version": 79,
      "versionNonce": 1507295182,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1758722362417,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 6: Sample Mini-Batch\n\nOnce enough experiences are collected:\n\nRandomly sample a mini-batch (e.g., 32 experiences) from the buffer.\n\nThis prevents the network from only learning short-term correlations.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 6: Sample Mini-Batch\n\nOnce enough experiences are collected:\n\nRandomly sample a mini-batch (e.g., 32 experiences) from the buffer.\n\nThis prevents the network from only learning short-term correlations.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "CXTf1AeEu6EkdLciWV6sN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 132.0886846537751,
      "y": 4153.824948437059,
      "width": 929.5556030273438,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "TV1HpIX2AZ4UyFB1qGTKX",
        "hvKSWD45A6-VhB9gx2ARX",
        "7AbNSvuwSHCRzG-bRdeIq",
        "hbAu7_xFaUE3wQnYuatSu"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bH9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1347957671,
      "version": 36,
      "versionNonce": 313677326,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1758722362417,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 7: Process Frames\n\nPreprocess sampled game frames:\n\nConvert images → grayscale, resize, normalize.\n\nNow each state is just numbers that can go into the CNN.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 7: Process Frames\n\nPreprocess sampled game frames:\n\nConvert images → grayscale, resize, normalize.\n\nNow each state is just numbers that can go into the CNN.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mMfc0ND9U-Htvtx2oCFpi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 142.0886846537751,
      "y": 4633.825139171922,
      "width": 1199.0875244140625,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "TV1HpIX2AZ4UyFB1qGTKX",
        "hvKSWD45A6-VhB9gx2ARX",
        "7AbNSvuwSHCRzG-bRdeIq",
        "hbAu7_xFaUE3wQnYuatSu"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 57569449,
      "version": 68,
      "versionNonce": 240673870,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1758722362417,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 8: Predict Q-values (Current State)\n\nFeed the current state of each sampled experience into the Main Network.\n\nGet predicted Q-values for all actions.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 8: Predict Q-values (Current State)\n\nFeed the current state of each sampled experience into the Main Network.\n\nGet predicted Q-values for all actions.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LckSDNp09E0fJ7waa4keT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 147.4219366069001,
      "y": 5139.158136811897,
      "width": 714.74365234375,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "TV1HpIX2AZ4UyFB1qGTKX",
        "hvKSWD45A6-VhB9gx2ARX",
        "7AbNSvuwSHCRzG-bRdeIq",
        "hbAu7_xFaUE3wQnYuatSu"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
