      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1758722362417,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 11: Update Weights\n\nPerform gradient descent to adjust Main Network weights.\n\nThe network slowly learns better Q-value predictio",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 11: Update Weights\n\nPerform gradient descent to adjust Main Network weights.\n\nThe network slowly learns better Q-value predictio",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xChOuoljoT3y5s46qDSBg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 146.0889287944001,
      "y": 6620.491398937547,
      "width": 841.2476806640625,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "TV1HpIX2AZ4UyFB1qGTKX",
        "hvKSWD45A6-VhB9gx2ARX",
        "7AbNSvuwSHCRzG-bRdeIq",
        "hbAu7_xFaUE3wQnYuatSu"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHE",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 686306503,
      "version": 136,
      "versionNonce": 1190448462,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1758722362417,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 12: Update Target Network (Periodically)\n\nEvery few steps (say every 1000 updates):\n\nCopy the Main Network weights → Target Network.\n\nKeeps training stable.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 12: Update Target Network (Periodically)\n\nEvery few steps (say every 1000 updates):\n\nCopy the Main Network weights → Target Network.\n\nKeeps training stable.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bQs9s25haoQCHWj4y1gzH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 150.0885625834626,
      "y": 7109.824895031297,
      "width": 992.3035888671875,
      "height": 495,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "TV1HpIX2AZ4UyFB1qGTKX",
        "hvKSWD45A6-VhB9gx2ARX",
        "7AbNSvuwSHCRzG-bRdeIq",
        "hbAu7_xFaUE3wQnYuatSu"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHF",
