      "seed": 1913086729,
      "version": 71,
      "versionNonce": 1506407310,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1758722362417,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 13: Loop\n\nThe agent repeats from Step 2:\n\nObserve → Choose Action → Store → Sample → Train.\n\nOver thousands of iterations:\n\nThe agent learns which actions maximize long-term rewards.\n\nEventually, it masters Pong 🎮.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 13: Loop\n\nThe agent repeats from Step 2:\n\nObserve → Choose Action → Store → Sample → Train.\n\nOver thousands of iterations:\n\nThe agent learns which actions maximize long-term rewards.\n\nEventually, it masters Pong 🎮.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
